# --- Generated archives -----------------------------------------------------
# The tool writes "<sources>_<YYYYMMDD-HHMMSS>.html" into the chosen output
# folder, appending _01, _02 on a same-second collision. Keep those out of
# version control wherever they land, including reports/.
*_[0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9].html
*_[0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9]_[0-9][0-9].html

